  "review": "The 2017 and July 2026 photographs agree on the signed approach from the south. The PMTiles south range and the paved approach visible in two aerial versions constrain the placement west of the range midpoint. The nominal 7 m setback remains approximate. The gate and fence ends are partially obscured in the aerial images. The four native viewer levels keep the mapped public paths, water and neighboring buildings. Failed loading restores the mapped court.",
