    "observation": "The Summer Palace festival photograph shows two red lanterns on the timber gate posts, the diamond-lattice fence and the same grey roof profile seen in the 2017 photograph. The paved approach passes through the gate toward the dark timber tea-room facade. The park’s festival map marks Water Village at the east side of the Farming and Weaving garden."
  },
